RewriteEngine on

# ACP-DefOnto
RewriteRule ^acp-defonto/?$ https://raw.githubusercontent.com/VictoriaChama/DefeasibleOntologies/main/ontologies/ACP-DefOnto/ontology/acp-defonto.rdf [R=302,L]

# Movie-DefOnto
RewriteRule ^movie-defonto/?$ https://raw.githubusercontent.com/VictoriaChama/DefeasibleOntologies/main/ontologies/Movie-DefOnto/ontology/movie-defonto.rdf [R=302,L]

# Edu-DefOnto
RewriteRule ^edu-defonto/?$ https://raw.githubusercontent.com/VictoriaChama/DefeasibleOntologies/main/ontologies/Edu-DefOnto/ontology/edu-defonto.rdf [R=302,L]
